  "description": "ND Observability Framework provides unified logging, tracing, and metrics\n\t\t\tcapabilities for .NET microservices using Serilog, OpenTelemetry, and\n\t\t\tdistributed tracing decorators. The framework simplifies instrumentation\n\t\t\tby offering pluggable logger services, trace interceptors, correlation ID\n\t\t\tpropagation, and out-of-the-box exporters for Loki, PostgreSQL, OTLP and Azure.",
  "id": "ND.FW.Observability",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-11T13:04:54.557Z",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "xacI4W0ugm13TonY/Hu+jEjLqS775UN1/Uf3WH5AIBclT1M+ubLKfXYQWCneZ+9gewBkVmoljxibUk4a8tdytg==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 41084,
  "published": "2026-08-11T13:01:15.77Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Version: 0.0.9\n\n\t\t\tAdded:\n\t\t\t- Ambient log context via new INDLogContextAccessor / NDLogContextAccessor\n\t\t\t(AsyncLocal-backed). ServiceName, CorrelationId, and custom unique/filter\n\t\t\tIDs can now be set once at the start of a request or message handler and\n\t\t\tare automatically attached to every subsequent log call within that\n\t\t\tasync flow, without needing to be passed explicitly each time.\n\t\t\t- New overloads on INDLoggerService (LogDebug/LogInformation/LogWarning/\n\t\t\tLogError/LogFatal) that omit serviceName and correlationId, resolving\n\t\t\tthem from ambient context instead. Existing method signatures are\n\t\t\tunchanged and continue to work exactly as before.\n\t\t\t- Explicit-over-ambient precedence: any explicitly passed serviceName,\n\t\t\tcorrelationId, or customUniqueIds value on a log call overrides its\n\t\t\tambient counterpart on a per-key basis; ambient values only fill in\n\t\t\tgaps left by explicit arguments.\n\n\t\t\tChanged:\n\t\t\t- NDLoggerService now takes a required INDLogContextAccessor dependency\n\t\t\t(registered automatically via AddNDLogging). Consumers using the\n\t\t\tstandard DI extension methods require no changes; only direct\n\t\t\t`new NDLoggerService(...)` call sites need updating.\n\n\t\t\tNotes:\n\t\t\t- No breaking changes to the public INDLoggerService contract for\n\t\t\texisting 7-argument Log* methods.",
  "repository": {
